 *
 * Policies are simple functions that run before your actions. The mapping is
 * matched most-specific-first, so a `controller/action` key beats a
 * `controller/*` key, which beats the catch-all `'*'`.
 *
 * @docs https://sailsjs.com/docs/concepts/policies
 */

